        "date_published": "2026-07-01T06:00:00+00:00",
        "description": "<img src='https://i.cbc.ca/ais/3b67b5af-2ef8-4962-ae4f-49daa1583b8f,1782752924420/full/max/0/default.jpg?im=Crop%2Crect%3D%280%2C0%2C1920%2C1080%29%3BResize%3D%28620%29' alt='' width='620' height='349' title=''/><p>Mark Canada\u2019s 159th birthday with live morning coverage hosted by David Common and Carolyn Ray from the Halifax Waterfront, before joining Adrienne Arsenault and Omar Dabaghi-Pacheco in Ottawa\u2019s LeBreton Flats Park. Join Saroja Coelho for a live call-in show from our Toronto studio. Then, Ian Hanomansing and Gloria Macarenko host live afternoon coverage from Banff's Bear Street, before heading back to LeBreton Flats at 7 p.m. ET with Adrienne Arsenault and Elamin Abdelmahmoud.</p>",
